Files carried over from zk-loan and modified (each keeps its original
copyright line and states that it was changed):
  contract/sacco-credit-gate.compact   (from contract/zk-loan.compact)
  contract/schnorr.compact
  contract/witnesses.ts
  contract/index.ts
  attestation-api/*.ts
  test/sacco-credit-gate.sim.test.ts   (from src/test/zk-loan.sim.test.ts)
