Summary of modifications: domain model renamed for savings and credit
cooperatives (creditScore -> repaymentScore, monthlyIncome -> monthlySavings,
monthsAsCustomer -> monthsAsMember); a six-month membership gate evaluated
before the tiers; new domain-separation strings for derived keys; tier amounts
labelled in ETB; new tests for the membership gate and for the absence of
profile data on the ledger; standalone npm build; narrated simulator demo.

Files written for this repository: demo/*, test/demo.test.ts, Makefile,
scripts/into-monorepo.sh, onchain/monorepo/*, .github/workflows/ci.yml and
the documentation (README.md, WALKTHROUGH.md, DEMO.md).

All member data in this repository is synthetic.

